Description: Linux mail client for Microsoft 365
 WaddleMail is a mail, calendar, contacts and tasks client for Microsoft 365
 and Outlook.com built on Microsoft Graph. It supports several accounts and
 shared mailboxes, favorites, folder management, an outbox, and desktop
 notifications.
